        "gg278iVjBgF_text": "<p>&nbsp;STANDARD PROBIOTICS</p>",
        "gg6TGs4HHlu_text": "<p>&nbsp;ACID-ARMOR™ DELIVERY</p>",
        "ggCHRMBGiuf_text": "<p>Here's what they don't tell you: Your stomach acid has a pH of around 1.5. Standard probiotics may begin dissolving before they ever reach your vaginal microbiome.</p>",
