        "ggTOX-raiJ8_childItem_2": "<p>~5% survival rate</p>",
        "ggTOX-raiJ8_childItem_3": "<p>Limited effectiveness</p>",
        "ggeIFCykXF5_text": "<p>We call it the \"Probiotic Graveyard\" — an industry that learned bigger numbers sell better, even when they don't work better.</p>",
