        "gg2KTdZ8tfI_childItem_0": "<p>Is my order discreet?</p>",
        "gg2KTdZ8tfI_childItem_1": "<p>How is FloraFresh different from other probiotics?</p>",
        "gg2KTdZ8tfI_childItem_2": "<p>How long until I see results?</p>",
        "gg2KTdZ8tfI_childItem_3": "<p>Are there any side effects?</p>",
        "gg2KTdZ8tfI_childItem_4": "<p>Can I take it with medications?</p>",
        "gg2KTdZ8tfI_childItem_5": "<p>Is FloraFresh safe during pregnancy or breastfeeding?</p>",
        "gg2KTdZ8tfI_childItem_6": "<p>What if it doesn't work for me?</p>",
        "gg2Oscwl-W8_text": "Frequently Asked Questions",
        "gg4a8x2zCkC_text": "<p>FloraFresh uses Acid-Armor™ delayed-release technology — a 3-step \"Flush &amp; Feed\" system featuring D-Mannose, 4 targeted Lactobacillus strains (15 Billion CFUs), and Prebiotic XOS designed to maximize absorption. Standard probiotics lose up to 95% of their bacteria in stomach acid.</p>",
        "ggJbZr565_u_text": "<p>While our ingredients are generally considered safe, we recommend consulting your OB-GYN before starting any new supplement during pregnancy or breastfeeding.</p>",
        "ggRqXQmTkxv_text": "<p>Most women notice initial improvements within 2-3 weeks. Significant results typically occur between weeks 3-4. We recommend committing to at least 90 days for optimal results.</p>",
        "ggYXA5zkioG_text": "<p>Yes! All orders ship in plain, unmarked packaging.</p>",
        "ggjhL2ttWiu_text": "<p>FloraFresh is generally well-tolerated. Some women experience mild digestive adjustment during the first few days. This typically resolves within 3-5 days.</p>",
        "ggmO4sNTttZ_text": "<p>We offer a 90-day \"Empty Bottle Promise\" guarantee. Full refund, no questions asked, even if the bottleis empty.</p>",
        "ggrHHYhxxS4_text": "<p>If you're taking antibiotics, we recommend taking FloraFresh at least 2 hours apart. For specific medication interactions, please consult your healthcare provider.</p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-602039852401426983"
    },
