    "gp_section_602783741558916058": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "008bd1f48b7c084575c8f669235d82e8d7194aea7c201e7ae18244eb1a239d5c_1_1_0_0__1",
        "gg3m3MNTPVu_text": "<p>-Michelle T., 47</p>",
        "gg9Ax5ygEaM_text": "<p><strong>- Ruth A., 63</strong></p>",
        "ggGZyXHDtAC_text": "<p>4.8/5 from 5,454 verified reviews</p>",
        "ggJ6hbYet5r_text": "<p>I threw away my 'just in case' underwear</p>",
        "ggJ8dJ0l2e7_text": "<p>I live with my adult daughter and her husband.<br>If they saw what I ordered, I'd move to another country.</p><p>Plain brown box. 'Wellness Nest' on the label.</p><p>Nobody knew. Nobody asked.</p><p>And it WORKS. 10/10, would be secretive again.</p>",
        "ggZHWRjT4oG_text": "<p>Menopause took a lot from me. Hot flashes. Sleep. My waistline.</p><p>But the thing that bothered me most? Nobody warned me</p><p>about what would happen DOWN THERE.</p><p>I felt broken. Unsexy. Old.</p><p>FloraFresh didn't fix everything. But it fixed the thing I was too embarrassed to even Google.</p><p>Now I'm telling everyone. You're welcome.</p>",
        "ggZa02R9sXa_text": "<p>- Diane M., 54</p>",
        "ggdxTobAAor_text": "<p>For two years I had every excuse in the book. Headache. Tired.</p><p>Early meeting tomorrow. My husband probably thought I'd lost interest.</p><p>Nope. Just lost my confidence.</p><p>Four weeks on FloraFresh and let's just say...</p><p>he's the one asking for a break now 😅</p>",
        "ggefJAhnDRq_text": "<p>Week 1: Nothing. I almost gave up.</p><p>Week 2: Wait... is that different? Maybe?</p><p>Week 3: Oh. OH. Okay yes this is different.</p><p>Week 4: <i>texts best friend</i> GET THIS IMMEDIATELY.</p><p>I'm not saying it's magic. I'm saying I stopped</p><p>making my husband sleep on the couch when I felt 'off.'</p><p>Make of that what you will.</p>",
        "gggsjVdNpC__text": "<p>Plot twist: I'm the one initiating now</p>",
        "gglLQRTXt6g_text": "<p>The box said NOTHING. Bless you.</p>",
        "ggm_4XHZ8--_text": "<p>-Patricia L., 39</p>",
        "ggrXyBUkEwQ_text": "<p>- Linda K., 61</p>",
        "ggriWWq2GMt_text": "<p>Nobody talks about this. So I will.</p>",
        "ggsBzsZGTsV_text": "Real Results from Real Women",
        "ggwPw2Em--R_text": "<p>Ladies, you know the pair. The one you keep in your purse.</p><p>The one for 'emergencies.'</p><p>Three weeks in, I realized I hadn't touched it.</p><p>That's when I knew this stuff actually works.</p>",
        "ggzf3H5KqZJ_text": "<p>Okay so here's what actually happens</p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-602783741558916058"
    },
