        "ggKFp6c_rKP_text": "<p>My husband noticed before I did.</p><p>He said \"you taste like you did when we first started dating\".</p><p>I almost cried. To the husbands reading this for your wives — you're a good one.</p>",
        "ggbgnXuatay_text": "<p>I can wear my favorite jeans again</p><p>Not because I lost weight (I wish 😂). Because I'm not paranoid about... you know... sitting too close to people. Crossing my legs weird. Wondering if anyone can tell.</p><p>That constant background anxiety? Gone. I forgot what it felt like to just NOT think about it.</p>",
        "ggeglurnb7a_text": "<p>My gynecologist asked what I changed.</p><p>That's it. That's the review.</p>",
        "gglNFUMbnQL_text": "<p><strong>— Brittany S., 35, Verified Buyer &nbsp;✓</strong></p>",
        "ggnywnbat8h_text": "<p><strong>— Carol R., 37, Verified Buyer &nbsp;✓</strong></p>"
      },
